<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>power_dBm = -20;&#x000D;&#x000A;freq_GHz = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;efficiency_dB = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;speedOfLight = 299792458;&#x000D;&#x000A;power_mW = 10^(power_dBm / 10);&#x000D;&#x000A;lambda = speedOfLight / (freq_GHz*1e9);&#x000D;&#x000A;efficiency = 10^(efficiency_dB / 10);&#x000D;&#x000A;pwrDensity_mW = power_mW * 4 * pi / lambda^2 / efficiency;&#x000D;&#x000A;pwrDensity_dBm = 10 * log10(pwrDensity_mW);</Text>
