<Item XName="Equations" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>Resolution = pi/180;&#x000D;&#x000A;TWOPI=2*pi;&#x000D;&#x000A;RefR = 50;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;theta = [0 : Resolution : pi];&#x000D;&#x000A;phi = [0 : Resolution : TWOPI];&#x000D;&#x000A;[THETA,PHI]=meshgrid(theta,phi);&#x000D;&#x000A;gridSize = numel(THETA);&#x000D;&#x000A;phiSize = length(phi);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;power_dBm = -20;&#x000D;&#x000A;power_W = 10^((power_dBm - 30) / 10);&#x000D;&#x000A;signal_V = sqrt(power_W * 2 * RefR);&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
