<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>STIMULUS: &#x000D;&#x000A;This is a raster scan of Theta and Phi,&#x000D;&#x000A;to create an incoming phase front &#x000D;&#x000A;that appears to arrive from a &#x000D;&#x000A;variety of positions on a virtual &#x000D;&#x000A;hemisphere.  Since the RX array is&#x000D;&#x000A;&quot;trained&quot; to look in a fixed direction,&#x000D;&#x000A;you have to sweep the stimulus, &#x000D;&#x000A;and plot the RX output as a function of&#x000D;&#x000A;the incident direction, in order to map&#x000D;&#x000A;the RX beam pattern.</DataEntry>
<TextParam><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></TextParam></Item></Item>
