<Text>runanalysis(&apos;DFRx&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;using(&apos;DFRx_DFRxSch_Data&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;gain = squeeze(gain);&#x000D;&#x000A;zenith = squeeze(zenith);&#x000D;&#x000A;azimuth = squeeze(azimuth);&#x000D;&#x000A;graph4=graph_figure(&apos;BeamPatternRFLinkRx&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;graph4.add_spherical_data(azimuth,zenith,max(gain,-30));</Text>
